            <img src="~/images/about-me.jpg" alt="Me at DreamCon holding a Pikachu plush" />
        </div>

        <div class="about-body">
            <p class="kicker">Hello!</p>
            <h2>Hi, I'm the baker behind Sakubook 🌷</h2>

            
            <p>
                Hi! I'm Chloe and I also go by Cookie on my dancing channel!
                I am based on Houston, TX and I love to read smut and fantasy books in my free time!
            </p>
            <p>
                I also play Dead by Daylight and Valorant!
            </p>
            <p class="about-links">
                <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@@cookienyanxd" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube</a>
                <a href="https://www.instagram.com/dancing.cookien/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
            </p>
            <!-- ✏️ END OF PLACEHOLDER -->

            <ul class="about-facts">
                <li><span>Favourite thing to bake</span> Cookies (i'm basic haha!)</li>
                <li><span>Always in my fridge</span> Rice lol</li>
                <li><span>Current obsession</span> Reading smut and horror and trying to get into fantasy romance!</li>
            </ul>

            <a class="btn-note" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Recipes">Browse my recipes</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
